00:53:50.200 --> 00:53:51.230
Serigala, harimau, kelinci, rusa.

00:53:51.230 --> 00:53:52.970
Masing-masing akan diberikan 10 anak panah.

00:53:53.430 --> 00:53:56.370
Demi pertarungan yang adil, nyonya istana dan pelayanmu

00:53:56.370 --> 00:53:57.670
